        <mxCell id="footer" value="Solid lines: the scan path, numbered in order (docs/architecture.md explains each step); the pre-check runs before any model and calls the tools MCP server directly. Any other line into a Gateway box is a call through that Gateway to the target it ends on. Dashed: the optional second round (one specialist) and brand_visual's web search. Bottom row: off the path, no lines.&#10;Opt-in direct path (-c directOrchestration=true): the worker calls the specialists and Opus itself. Every AWS call is signed with SigV4." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;">
